                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "TwhyK",
                  "name": "Notes",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "B68jSf",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• X-ray button gets a ▾: click the icon toggles X-ray, click ▾ (or long-press) opens this menu. Menu closes on Esc / click-outside; choices apply live.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "EybNo",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Colour by Tag role: every structure element uses its role colour (tokens role-heading, role-p, role-figure, role-caption, role-table, role-list, role-link, role-inline, role-group; artifacts stay #8A93A3). Custom roles use their RoleMap target's colour. 'Edit tag colours…' lets the user override per role (persisted).",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "MMEWe",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• All tag boxes: outlines every StructElem's page bbox at once, without a click, plus a role chip (H1, P, Figure…) left of the box. Nesting draws Sect/Div as thin neutral containers with a chip at their top-right.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "AgejN",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Reading order: numbered badges (accent) at each element's right edge, joined by a 2 px accent path in reading order. A step that goes back up the page (or reads content before its container/figure) turns amber, gets an amber badge and an inline note, and is listed in Diagnostics as 'reading-order-backtrack'.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "xLMB3",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Reading order from: Structure tree (logical /K order, what screen readers use) or Paint order (content stream order). Switching shows where the two disagree.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nH4ha",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• The tree dots, canvas boxes and legend all use the same role colour, so a role reads the same everywhere. The legend dims roles with 0 elements on the page.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "iztNL",
                      "name": "N",
                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "• Keys: ⇧T all tag boxes · L labels · R reading order.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
