        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "qBL3o",
          "name": "Sec 9 · Continuous scroll",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 6,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "LQPUi",
              "name": "H",
              "fill": "#E7EAEE",
              "content": "9 · Continuous scroll & floating cards",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "CJ2Hy",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• All pages in one vertical column, centred, 16 pt apart and 16 pt around. Only visible pages render; a page still rendering is a blank sheet (#181C21, 1 px #252A31) with 'Rendering…' in text-3.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vr4vl",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Current page = the page with the largest visible height after a scroll; clicking or dragging on a page makes it current without scrolling. The page field, Content tree, Operators / Paint order drawers, stepper, isolation, clip overlay, hit stack and rulers follow the current page.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "rKSfB",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Prev / Next, the page field and Pages thumbnails scroll the target page's top to 16 pt below the view top; thumbnails highlight the current page as you scroll.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "z17dKd",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Fit = fit the largest page in the document, so zoom doesn't jump across mixed page sizes.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bRDuf",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• On every visible page: page boxes, validation badges, hover / preview / selection outlines, measure line. Only on the current page: paint-order ghosts. Selecting a node on another page scrolls there and centres it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "CTotm",
              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Screens 2.x show the view scrolled ~47 px so page 2's top edge peeks below page 1 (labelled 'p2' in the margin).",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
