              "name": "N",
              "fill": "#A2AAB6",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Floating cards (X-ray legend, page boxes, measure readout, stepper) anchor to the canvas's top-right corner, 14 px from the edges and below the ruler. They never sit over a page: if the gap between the page and the canvas edge is too narrow, they collapse to a chip ('4 kinds ▾') that expands on hover. The paint stepper anchors bottom-centre of the canvas, above the drawer strip.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
