          "content": "Usage · App icon: macOS squircle, artwork 824/1024 centred with the system shadow. Rail: 28 px small version. Empty / opening states: 72 / 48 px. Site: favicon 16/32 small version, apple-touch 180 master, nav mark 28 px + wordmark. Never recolour the letters, never drop the blueprint tile, keep the P cut at the left edge.",
