        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "J0eKYU",
          "name": "Rules",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YiOhN",
              "name": "Rules title",
              "fill": "#E7EAEE",
              "content": "Rules",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 18,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DMPh0",
              "name": "Rule 1",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "1.  Caption card (Site/CaptionCard) floats inside the screenshot window, never below it. 320 px wide, solid #12161B at 95% (no backdrop blur: it would repaint on every scroll frame), so it stays readable on any screenshot.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "dLdnW",
              "name": "Rule 2",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "2.  Placement: on the side of the spot with the most room, 28 px from the spot. Preference: right, then left, then below, then above. It never covers the spot. A 1 px cyan leader with a dot connects the card to the spot.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "IbRXt",
              "name": "Rule 3",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "3.  Focus: everything outside the spot dims to 55% (scrim #05070A8C). The spot gets a 1.5 px cyan outline and a soft glow.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "YycBG",
              "name": "Rule 4",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "4.  Motion per slide: the camera pans, then the scrim and spot fade in, then the card rises 12 px and fades in. On the way out the card leaves first. Between chapters the scrim lifts so the overview is clean.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "UV0uc",
              "name": "Rule 5",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "5.  The window grows (no caption row underneath): height = 100vh − 220 px, 16:10. The chapter summary is shown as the card during the overview, anchored bottom-left of the window.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "qcuH6",
              "name": "Rule 6",
              "fill": "#A9B1BC",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "6.  Mobile and reduced motion: a static list. Cards become normal text under each screenshot.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "M9gqUr",
              "name": "Component label",
              "fill": "#6B7480",
              "content": "Component · Site/CaptionCard",
              "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 1
