                      "content": "The chaise as a technical drawing: dimensions, an angle mark, callouts, crop crosshairs and a title block. The most on-brand (it echoes the logo), and it carries the ‘612 × 792 pt patient’ joke naturally.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
